        *   Found A->BC: NT36 -> NT4 NT24 (NT4 from P[5][5], NT24 from P[6][6]).
        *   Result: {NT36}
    *   P[6][7] (t13 t20):
        *   k=6: B in P[6][6]({NT37,NT24}), C in P[7][7]({NT34,NT28})
