        *   k=1: (P[1][1], P[2][3]) -> ({NT11,NT15,NT24}, {}) -> {}
        *   k=2: (P[1][2], P[3][3]) -> ({NT11}, {NT4}). No A->NT11 NT4. -> {}
        *   Result: {}
    *   P[2][4] (t7 t3 t8):
        *   k=2: (P[2][2], P[3][4]) -> ({NT14,NT26}, {}) -> {}
        *   k=3: (P[2][3], P[4][4]) -> ({}, {NT3}) -> {}
        *   Result: {}
    *   P[3][5] (t3 t8 t3):
        *   k=3: (P[3][3], P[4][5]) -> ({NT4}, {}) -> {}
